OL,3,GNEWSATrain attacker thought boy was
OL,4,A'devil', jury hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FA knifeman accused of trying to kill 10
OL,7,Fpeople on a train had stabbed a
OL,8,Fteenager on another train earlier that
OL,9,Fday, appearing to believe his victim
OL,10,Fwas the devil, a court heard.
OL,12,FAnthony Williams attacked 17-year-old
OL,13,FIsaiah Idris on a Docklands Light
OL,14,FRailway (DLR) train in London in the
OL,15,Fearly hours of 1 November, the same day
OL,16,Fhe is accused of a mass stabbing on a
OL,17,Ftrain that had to make an unscheduled
OL,18,Fstop in Huntingdon, Cambridgeshire.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
