OL,3,GNEWSATrain attacker thought boy was
OL,4,A'devil', jury hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FCambridge Crown Court heard how
OL,7,FMacarena Lopez, who saw the DLR attack,
OL,8,Fhad said in an interview she felt
OL,9,FIdris's attacker had been having a
OL,10,F"psychotic episode".
OL,12,FWilliams, 33, from Peterborough, denies
OL,13,F14 counts of attempted murder.
